ign=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>地址：</strong>宁夏银川市西夏区朔方路160号 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>联系方式：</strong>0951-2176950 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>2.采购代理机构信息（如有）</strong> </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>名称：</strong><label class=\"whiteListField\">华夏晨光（宁夏）工程咨询有限公司</label> </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>地址：</strong>银川市贺兰县虹桥街陕西大厦B座22层2201室 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>联系方式：</strong> 0951-8593145 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>3.项目联系方式</strong> </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>采购人项目联系人：</strong>贾辰钰 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>电话：</strong>0951-2176950 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>代理机构项目联系人：</strong>陈金、马丽、张晶 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>电话：</strong> 0951-8593145 </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> <strong align=\"left\">五、附件</strong> </p> \n    <p align=\"left\"> <strong>采购文件</strong>： </p> \n    <p align=\"center\"> </p>\n    <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"paper_area\" style=\"width:100%;border:0px #a5bed2 solid;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px auto;font-size:14px;table-layout:fixed;\" id=\"fileTable\"> \n     <tbody>\n      <tr> \n       <td align=\"left\" width=\"90%\" style=\"COLOR: #555;line-height:25px;padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #a5bed2;border-collapse:collapse;\"> <a href=\"https://222.75.70.90:7075/NXGPPSP_MG/downloadFileServlet?num=8b80b23e9e87eed8019e8b9ee2c80720&amp;flag=isWebsite\" id=\"fileNameA0\" title=\"招标文件正文.pdf\" style=\"display:block; text-dec